OL,3,GNEWSAThieves steal #7,000 worth of
OL,4,Atools from hospice
OL,5,
OL,6,FThieves have stolen maintenance and
OL,7,Frepair equipment worth more than #7,000
OL,8,Fafter breaking into a hospice.
OL,10,FThe tools were taken from the Sue Ryder
OL,11,FManorlands Hospice, in Oxenhope, near
OL,12,FKeighley, in the early hours of
OL,13,FWednesday, the organisation said.
OL,15,FWest Yorkshire Police said inquiries
OL,16,Finto the break-in "remain ongoing" and
OL,17,Fhave appealed to anyone with
OL,18,Finformation to get in touch.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
