OL,3,GNEWSAThieves steal #7,000 worth of
OL,4,Atools from hospice
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdam Brunkskill, regional fundraising
OL,7,Fteam manager at the hospice, said:
OL,8,F"Every penny we spend on replacing
OL,9,Ftools and repairing the damage is money
OL,10,Fthat we would much rather be putting
OL,11,Ftowards caring for patients and
OL,12,Fsupporting their families."
